  "review": [
    "Independent actual SCCB specification PDF retrieval matches owner reference SHA. Narrow2wire profile explicitly ignores transmitted ninth DC high/low and releases final read NA, with STOP between pointer phase and read phase; original3wire SCCB_E and analog contention behavior are not claimed.",
    "Independent6profiles use no owner model/helper; HALF4/13 times I2C8/I2C16/SCCB8 check exact byte ordering, repeated START versus STOP-separated read, mixed high/low DC, NACK full-descriptor retry, masked VERIFY mismatch retry then success, descriptor/start snapshots, CE0 physical progress and stable done backpressure,37cycle delay and END exactly at descriptor limit.",
    "Full source/PHY dependency closure preserved before and after tests. All34 owner labels unique and actual simulation log SHA match; full synthesis reports independently recounted with shared PHY included."
  ],
