  "limitations": [
    "Ideal digital pin models; no actual image sensor, sensor initialization-table correctness, electrical timing closure or combined-board fit validated.",
    "No absent-descriptor timeout: external provider must supply descriptors or reset. SCCB WRITE DC cannot establish target presence; sensor-ID readback required.",
    "Retry suitable for idempotent register settings; side-effect register use requires integration review. Single-master, single-target open-drain profile only."
